OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 9 APR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GThe plainsong-inspired theme
OL,11,     Gcontinues with highlights from
OL,12,     GMonteverdi's Vespers of 1610 in a
OL,13,     Gspecially made recording from
OL,14,     GMonaco, plus Chopin, Schumann and
OL,15,     GFalla from Perth.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gershwin
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod tells the story of
OL,18,     GGeorge Gershwin's first
OL,19,     Gexperience of working in
OL,20,     GHollywood.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
