OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 9 APR
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GPianist Edward Leung performs
OL,6,     Glive in the studio and we talk to
OL,7,     GMark Ravenhill on directing a new
OL,8,     Gproduction of Salome by Regents
OL,9,     GOpera.
OL,10,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,11,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,12,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,13,     Gfavourites, including music by
OL,14,     GElgar, Schubert and Ravel.
OL,15,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,16,     GFrom Birmingham, the CBSO plays
OL,17,     GRachmaninov's Rhapsody on a theme
OL,18,     Gof Paganini with pianist Nelson
OL,19,     GGoerner, alongside music by
OL,20,     GHindemith and Bartok's Concerto
OL,21,     Gfor Orchestra.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
