OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 9 APR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Healing Musicians
OL,5,     GKate Kennedy meets Ludwig Quandt,
OL,6,     Gprincipal cellist of the Berlin
OL,7,     GPhilharmonic, to discover how an
OL,8,     Gunexpected injury forced him to
OL,9,     Grethink his life and career.
OL,10,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,11,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,12,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,13,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,14,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,15,     Geverything in between.
OL,16,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,17,     GSoweto shares more exciting new
OL,18,     Gjazz selections including a track
OL,19,     Gfrom the leading British jazz,
OL,20,     Greggae and soul singer Julie
OL,21,     GDexter, and Allexa Nava presents
OL,22,     Ganother Flowers pick.
